  "described": {
    "alt_text": "A square pastel painting of lobed pink, orange and lilac mountains with flying pods, over green fields dotted with small figures, signed crump.",
    "description": "A square oil painting in flat pastel colour with thin dark outlines, signed crump at lower left. A large pink and orange lobed mountain with a cream face like patch rises at upper right, and a lilac and pink pod shaped form with a pointed nose hovers at upper left like a spaceship. Two smaller green pods fly between them under outlined clouds. Below, rolling fields in lime, mint and salmon are dotted with rows of tiny figures and rounded rocks, with a lilac boulder at lower left. The surface is matte and the forms soft.",
    "impression": "Mountains that might be ships, or ships that might be mountains, both hovering over a field of tiny onlookers. The ambiguity is the point. It has the quiet of a landscape and the suspense of an arrival.",
